### 1. Buy 10 AAPL at 150
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "type": "BUY",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 150,
  "date": "2026-11-01"
}

### 2. Buy 10 AAPL at 170
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "type": "BUY",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 170,
  "date": "2026-11-05"
}

### 3. Sell 5 AAPL at 175
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "type": "SELL",
  "quantity": 5,
  "price": 175,
  "date": "2026-11-10"
}

### 4. Set current price
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/prices/AAPL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 180
}

### 5. See holdings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holdings

### 6. See summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/portfolio/summary

### 7. All transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions